---
import ChatMockup from './ChatMockup.astro';
import { LINKS } from '../lib/links';

const headline = 'Registrar la asistencia no es lo mismo que probarla.';
const words = headline.split(' ');

const bullets = [
  'Desde 25 empleados, sin tope',
  'Tarifa plana, no por empleado',
  'Sin app que instalar',
];
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-16 sm:pt-36 sm:pb-24">
  <!-- fondo con deriva lenta -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="aurora pointer-events-none absolute -inset-[10%] -z-10"
    style="background:
      radial-gradient(48rem 30rem at 85% 0%, rgb(53 161 98 / 0.08), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(40rem 26rem at 0% 100%, rgb(15 50 55 / 0.05), transparent 60%);"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-14 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-10">
    <div>
      <p
        class="animate-fade-up inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 rounded-full border border-neutral-200 bg-white py-1.5 pr-4 pl-3 text-[0.8rem] shadow-sm"
      >
        <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
        <span class="font-medium text-ink-900">Registro de Asistencia por WhatsApp</span>
        <span class="font-semibold text-neutral-500">· LFT Art. 132, Fr. XXXIV</span>
      </p>

      <h1
        class="font-display mt-6 text-[2.6rem] leading-[1.05] font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl"
        aria-label={headline}
      >
        {
          words.map((word, i) => (
            <>
              <span class="hw-mask" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="hw" style={`--hw-i: ${i}`}>
                  {word}
                </span>
              </span>
              {i < words.length - 1 && ' '}
            </>
          ))
        }
      </h1>

      <p
        class="animate-fade-up mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600"
        style="animation-delay: 0.45s"
      >
        Tu equipo checa desde WhatsApp, sin instalar nada. Klokk guarda cada registro con hora de
        servidor, ubicación y sellado certificado NOM-151, <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-900">en un expediente que puedes exhibir el día que te lo pidan.</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="animate-fade-up mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3.5" style="animation-delay: 0.55s">
        <a
          href={LINKS.demo}
          class="btn-press rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-brand-600/25 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-brand-700 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-brand-600/25"
        >
          Agendar demo de 20 min
        </a>
        <a
          href={LINKS.whatsapp}
          class="btn-press rounded-full border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-ink-900 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-neutral-400"
        >
          Escribirnos por WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>

      <ul
        class="animate-fade-up mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-2.5 text-[0.9rem] text-neutral-600"
        style="animation-delay: 0.65s"
      >
        {
          bullets.map((b) => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-brand-600">
                <path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11" />
              </svg>
              {b}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.35s">
      <ChatMockup />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
